<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day of the</p>
<p>first test between Sri Lanka and India on Monday:</p>
<p>India first innings 537-8 declared (N.Sidhu 111, S.Tendulkar</p>
<p>143, M.Azharuddin 126)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings (overnight 39-1)</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya not out			175</p>
<p> M.Atapattu c Mongia b Kulkarni	   26</p>
<p> R.Mahanama not out			  115</p>
<p> Extras (b-1, lb-1, nb-4)		    6</p>
<p> Total					   322</p>
<p>Fall of wicket 1-39</p>
<p>To bat: A.de Silva, A.Ranatunga, M.Jayawardena,</p>
<p>R.Kaluwitharana, C.Vaas, R.Pushpakumara, M.Muralitharan, J.Silva</p>
<p>Bowling: Prasad 16-1-50-0, Kuruvilla 7-2-24-0 (1nb),</p>
<p>Chauahan 26-3-86-0 (1nb), Kumble 20-3-83-0 (2nb), Kulkarni</p>
<p>20-3-57-1, Ganguly 2-0-18-0, Tendulkar 1-0-2-0</p>
